---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/nav/Breadcrumb.astro';

const updated = 'January 1, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | MazePuzzles.io"
  description="MazePuzzles.io terms of service — the rules for using our free maze generator and printable maze library."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    <Breadcrumb crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />

    <div class="mt-4 mb-8">
      <h1 class="mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-h2:text-xl prose-h2:mt-8 prose-h2:mb-3 prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-ul:text-slate-600 prose-li:mb-1">

      <p>
        Welcome to MazePuzzles.io. By using this website, you agree to the following terms.
        Please read them carefully.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of MazePuzzles.io</h2>
      <p>
        MazePuzzles.io provides free maze puzzles and a maze generator for personal, educational,
        and non-commercial use. You may:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Browse, play, and print mazes for personal enjoyment</li>
        <li>Print and distribute mazes in classrooms and educational settings</li>
        <li>Share links to mazes on social media and personal websites</li>
        <li>Use the maze generator to create mazes for personal projects</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Prohibited Uses</h2>
      <p>You may not:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use mazes generated by or downloaded from MazePuzzles.io in commercial products, publications, or merchandise without obtaining explicit written permission</li>
        <li>Scrape, crawl, or systematically download the maze catalog in ways that place excessive load on our servers</li>
        <li>Reproduce or redistribute large portions of the maze catalog in another service or product</li>
        <li>Use MazePuzzles.io in ways that violate applicable laws or regulations</li>
        <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, compromise, or disrupt MazePuzzles.io's infrastructure</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Commercial Use</h2>
      <p>
        If you wish to use MazePuzzles.io content in commercial products (such as activity books, puzzle
        books, KDP publications, apps, or merchandise), please contact us to discuss licensing.
        We offer licensing for reasonable commercial uses.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The maze generation algorithm, website design, and original content on MazePuzzles.io are
        our intellectual property. The specific mazes generated are mathematical objects;
        the copyright status of algorithmically generated mazes may vary by jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        MazePuzzles.io is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We do not guarantee
        that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or that any specific maze will
        be available at any given time.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, MazePuzzles.io shall not be liable for any
        indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from
        your use of the service.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. We will update the
        "Last updated" date when we do so. Continued use of MazePuzzles.io after changes
        constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by applicable law. Disputes shall be resolved in the
        jurisdiction where MazePuzzles.io operates.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
